            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you stop the witch and save the children?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521560/extras/101d6eef4ee0a3800cb0d803b0a58edd.poster.avif?t=1781941083\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521560/extras/101d6eef4ee0a3800cb0d803b0a58edd.webm?t=1781941083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521560/extras/101d6eef4ee0a3800cb0d803b0a58edd.mp4?t=1781941083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funded on Kickstarter with <strong>backers including legend of the genre Ron Gilbert</strong>, The Mystery of Woolley Mountain is an otherworldly adventure game <strong>filled with strange beasts, evil witches, confused automatons and wacky ropemen</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521560/extras/6e7070bc0719dc815280a355f9864cbf.poster.avif?t=1781941083\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521560/extras/6e7070bc0719dc815280a355f9864cbf.webm?t=1781941083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521560/extras/6e7070bc0719dc815280a355f9864cbf.mp4?t=1781941083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a <strong>renegade crew of time-travelling audio scientists</strong> on a hilarious and fantastical quest. A malevolent witch has captured a group of children, and it’s up to you to save them from the mysterious island of Woolley Mountain! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521560/extras/f03892f7d2a382ab0efa5bc6ce10a219.poster.avif?t=1781941083\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521560/extras/f03892f7d2a382ab0efa5bc6ce10a219.webm?t=1781941083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521560/extras/f03892f7d2a382ab0efa5bc6ce10a219.mp4?t=1781941083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a <strong>rich and interactive set of environments</strong>, filled with head-scratching puzzles. Unravel a salacious storyline, meet a cornucopia of quirky characters, and boogie on down to an awesome original soundtrack!​ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521560/extras/750912e6333cf6c9dbb98a927392f127.avif?t=1781941083\" width=600 height=72 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colourful world: A fantastical sprawling universe, populated by beasts, witches, automatons, ropemen and other strange and wonderful beings.\u000b<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521560/extras/e2cdcde0bb535b3e1105a4cc4cda754c.poster.avif?t=1781941083\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521560/extras/e2cdcde0bb535b3e1105a4cc4cda754c.webm?t=1781941083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521560/extras/e2cdcde0bb535b3e1105a4cc4cda754c.mp4?t=1781941083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Family content and all-ages humour: No swearing... well, maybe the word ‘darn’ on occasion!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521560/extras/101d6eef4ee0a3800cb0d803b0a58edd.poster.avif?t=1781941083\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521560/extras/101d6eef4ee0a3800cb0d803b0a58edd.webm?t=1781941083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521560/extras/101d6eef4ee0a3800cb0d803b0a58edd.mp4?t=1781941083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Striking 2D graphics: Adventure Time meets the Simpsons in Woolley Mountain’s lovingly crafted art style.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521560/extras/0163a84de69bf608293aace0a03640cc.poster.avif?t=1781941083\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521560/extras/0163a84de69bf608293aace0a03640cc.webm?t=1781941083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521560/extras/0163a84de69bf608293aace0a03640cc.mp4?t=1781941083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u000bGripping story: The five scientists travel in their amazing time-traversing Crystal Submarine from island to island. Can they make it to the dangerous island of Woolley mountain, destroy the evil witch, and rescue the kids?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521560/extras/060ada45149e63107df3bdd4cbb561fd.poster.avif?t=1781941083\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521560/extras/060ada45149e63107df3bdd4cbb561fd.webm?t=1781941083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521560/extras/060ada45149e63107df3bdd4cbb561fd.mp4?t=1781941083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
